---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { hospital, faqs, articles } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="250-bed hospital in Sector 89, Faridabad" description="Discover The Circadian Hospital, a 250-bed hospital in Sector 89, Faridabad associated with Dr BRC. Explore DIP Diet, plan your visit or call 8512040000.">
  <section class="hero">
    <img class="hero-image" src="/images/circadian-forest.webp" alt="Sunlight filtering through a green forest" width="1200" height="1600" fetchpriority="high"/>
    <div class="container hero-inner"><h1>A different rhythm of care.</h1><p>A 250-bed hospital in Faridabad, with Dr BRC’s approach to wellbeing.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Plan your visit <Icon name="northeast" size={19}/></a><a class="hero-call" href={`tel:${hospital.phone}`}><Icon name="phone" size={18}/> {hospital.displayPhone}</a></div></div>
    <span class="hero-caption">Illustrative nature photography</span>
  </section>
  <section class="hospital-strip" aria-label="Hospital at a glance"><div class="container strip-grid"><div class="strip-item"><strong>250</strong><span>Beds at our<br/>Faridabad hospital</span></div><div class="strip-item"><Icon name="pin" size={27}/><span><span class="strip-title">Sector 89</span>Faridabad, Delhi NCR</span></div><div class="strip-item"><Icon name="leaf" size={27}/><span><span class="strip-title">Food. Routine. Understanding.</span>Explore our approach to wellbeing</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container intro-grid"><h2>Your everyday life belongs in the conversation.</h2><div class="intro-copy"><p class="lead">Food, sleep and daily routines are part of your story. We believe they deserve thoughtful attention.</p><p>At The Circadian Hospital in Faridabad, discover the approach behind Dr BRC’s work and take an informed first step with reception.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Get to know our hospital <Icon name="northeast" size={18}/></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section rhythm-section"><div class="container rhythm-grid"><figure class="rhythm-picture"><img src="/images/morning-path.webp" width="960" height="640" loading="lazy" alt="A sunlit path winding through trees"/><figcaption>A moment in nature. Illustrative photography.</figcaption></figure><div><h2>A rhythm that considers the whole day.</h2><div class="approach-list"><a class="approach-row" href="/circadian-approach/"><span class="approach-number">01</span><div><h3>Understand your body clock</h3><p>Explore how light, sleep and daily routines relate to circadian rhythms.</p></div><Icon name="northeast" size={20}/></a><a class="approach-row" href="/dip-diet/"><span class="approach-number">02</span><div><h3>Make space for nutrition</h3><p>Meet Dr BRC’s plant-based DIP Diet framework.</p></div><Icon name="northeast" size={20}/></a><a class="approach-row" href="/patient-guide/"><span class="approach-number">03</span><div><h3>Start with your own story</h3><p>Bring your questions, prescriptions and relevant reports.</p></div><Icon name="northeast" size={20}/></a></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container dip-grid"><div><h2>Good food starts with understanding.</h2><p class="lead">An introduction to the DIP Diet, developed by Dr Biswaroop Roy Chowdhury.</p><p>Discover its focus on plant foods and thoughtful daily choices, with individual advice before making changes.</p><a class="text-link" href="/dip-diet/">Explore the DIP Diet <Icon name="northeast" size={18}/></a><div class="gentle-note">Dietary changes should fit your medical needs. Continue prescribed treatment unless your treating clinician advises otherwise.</div></div><figure class="dip-image"><img src="/images/nutrition-apples.webp" width="1000" height="870" loading="lazy" alt="Fresh apples in a wicker basket"/><figcaption>Whole foods, shown for illustration.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
  <section class="founder-section"><div class="container founder-grid"><div class="founder-photo"><img src="/images/dr-brc.webp" alt="Dr Biswaroop Roy Chowdhury" width="600" height="900" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="founder-copy"><h2>The thinking behind a different approach.</h2><p>Meet the creator of the DIP Diet and learn about his work in nutrition and health education.</p><span class="founder-name">Dr Biswaroop Roy Chowdhury</span><p class="small">Known as Dr BRC</p><a class="text-link" href="/dr-biswaroop-roy-chowdhury/">Read about Dr BRC <Icon name="northeast" size={18}/></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><h2>A little understanding goes a long way.</h2><a class="text-link" href="/journal/">Read the health journal <Icon name="northeast" size={18}/></a></div><div class="journal-grid">{articles.map((article, i) => <article class="journal-item"><small>{['Daily rhythms', 'Food & nutrition', 'Your first visit'][i]}</small><h3>{article.title}</h3><p>{article.intro}</p><a class="text-link" href={`/${article.slug}/`}>Read article <Icon name="northeast" size={17}/></a></article>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="section visit-section"><div class="container visit-grid"><div><h2>Your first step can be a conversation.</h2><p>Our reception can help you plan a visit and confirm the details that matter to you.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact reception <Icon name="northeast" size={18}/></a><a class="text-link" href="/patient-guide/">Before your visit</a></div></div><div class="visit-address"><Icon name="pin" size={30}/><h3>Find us in Sector 89.</h3><p>{hospital.address}</p><a class="text-link" href={hospital.maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find this address on Maps <Icon name="northeast" size={17}/></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container faq-grid"><div><h2>Before you visit.</h2><p>A few answers to help you begin.</p><a class="text-link" href={`tel:${hospital.phone}`}>Ask reception <Icon name="phone" size={17}/></a></div><div>{faqs.map(([question, answer]) => <details><summary>{question}<Icon name="plus" size={20}/></summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
</Layout>
